# Copy to .env and fill in. The backend's dev profile reads .env from the repo root; production uses real
# environment variables (see docs/deployment.md). The key id reaches the browser from the server with each
# order, so the frontend needs no Razorpay variable, and the key secret never leaves the backend.
RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=
RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=
RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
